// Whirlpool specifics: two ice-maker types -- modular crescent-mold (mold heater ~72 ohm
// + thermostat + feeler arm) and in-door optical (infrared) bin-sensor; reset = reset
// button / unplug / feeler-arm cycle (OEM producthelp). Platform note (Whirlpool/Maytag/
